l. It’s all about finding the right balance between being thorough and keeping things simple. I’ll be careful to ensure my answer meets these expectations!\"}]}"},{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] Understood. Please try to get **urgent in-person evaluation today** if you can, given the **blood in the urine, weight loss, persistent pain, and the imaging signal**.\n\nIf you want, I can next help you with **one clear summary message for your doctor / ER team**, or you can run the **LLM Distillation** tool for a more complete medical report of this conversation and the suggested next steps.","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_018f1b0fb3360e1d0169d92cbe8b5881919d9ef2b60dc9657a\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":12530,"output":117,"cacheRead":17152,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":29799,"cost":{"input":0.031325000000000006,"output":0.001755,"cacheRead":0.004288,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.037368000000000005}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1775840442937}}
