{"type":"message","id":"6517cce3","parentId":"2525cf9b","timestamp":"2026-04-10T17:02:30.105Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] Here is a short message you can copy:\n\n**Message for doctor / ER**\nI have a history of renal cell carcinoma with prior nephrectomy and I am currently on sunitinib. Over the last few months I have developed worsening right-sided lower back/flank pain, marked fatigue, visible blood in my urine, burning with urination, urinary urgency, and about 23 kg of unintentional weight loss over 3 months. I also ran a preliminary kidney CT pipeline that flagged a suspicious kidney tumor signal. I would like urgent evaluation, including urine testing, kidney function labs, and formal imaging review.\n\nTake care, and please get seen as soon as you can.","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_018f1b0fb3360e1d0169d92d23553c81919e82454f24094be8\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":4048,"output":146,"cacheRead":29824,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":34018,"cost":{"input":0.01012,"output":0.00219,"cacheRead":0.007456,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.019766000000000002}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1775840546089}}
